# Client (Vite) environment variables — PLACEHOLDERS ONLY. Never commit secrets.
# Vite exposes ONLY variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle, so never
# put a secret in a VITE_ variable.
#
# The client currently calls the API at the same origin under /api and requires
# no variables. Add VITE_-prefixed entries here if that changes.
# VITE_API_BASE=/api

# Phase 2 Supabase shadow auth shell — OFF by default. The legacy SQLite app
# runs unchanged unless ALL THREE values are set. Point these only at a LOCAL
# Supabase stack (the anon key is the local development key, not a secret from
# any real project); never commit a real URL or key.
# VITE_SHADOW_AUTH=supabase
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-local-anon-key
